  "goodToKnow": "Die Netzhaut is the retina, the light-sensitive layer at the back of the eye; medically die Retina. Eye problems include die Netzhautablösung (detached retina). Other parts of the eye: die Hornhaut (cornea), die Linse (lens), die Iris, die Pupille. Das Netz means net and network. Plural: die Netzhäute."
